    "contract": "Host resumes only. Guest exceptions validate mcause/mtval and advance their own mepc; actual source112 ISR checks RAW and clears through CLR,mret. Guest then creates a valid mapping,writes and reads data,prints PASS. No host PC/register repair or mailbox fabrication."
